{ q: "Which thought experiment, introduced by philosopher Philippa Foot, asks whether it is permissible to divert a runaway trolley to kill one person instead of five?", a: ["The Prisoner's Dilemma","The Trolley Problem","The Veil of Ignorance","The Ship of Theseus"], correct: "The Trolley Problem", explanation: "The Trolley Problem probes the tension between deontological constraints (don't kill) and consequentialist reasoning (minimize deaths), and has spawned decades of moral philosophy research." }
